  m_Name: GardenTowerRecord
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Caffeine.Gameplay.Quests.MerchantQuestDefinition
  <QuestId>k__BackingField: garden-tower-record
  speaker: Merchant
  title: Recover the System Garden Tower record
  destinationId: 
  Puzzle:
    rid: 5555647664672473497
  coinReward: 0
  arrivalRadius: 3
  offer:
  - The first record confirms that different periods are overlapping. Recover the
    next reference record at the System Garden Tower so we can compare them.
  - Enter through the open gate in the garden fence. Recover the record and return
    here for verification and your next weapon.
  inProgress:
  - I've checked the Cussonia Court record. The archive is trying to rebuild several
    versions of the same place at once, and we need the System Garden Tower record
    to see how far the damage goes.
  - Use the open gate in the garden fence. Bring the record back for verification
    and your next weapon.
  readyToTurnIn:
  - You have the record. Submit it for verification and collect your weapon.
  completed:
  - That explains the Residues. The archive has joined living things to machinery
    from other periods. Bring me the Northern Walks record so we can find out why
    it keeps going.
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds:
    - rid: 5555647664672473497
      type: {class: MerchantQuestDefinition/PuzzleStep, ns: Caffeine.Gameplay.Quests, asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
