        title: System Garden Tower record
        displayName: Courtyard Wall Gap
        sceneName: CourtyardWallGap
        rewardWeapon: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4ca64056e4164dfa9194203af8c4aeef, type: 2}
        archiveRecord: The Residues are failed reconstructions. Incomplete biological
          records have been joined to machinery and structures from other periods,
          leaving parts that never belonged together in a single body.
